&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atolls is the world’s largest community-driven shopping platform, active in 20+ markets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;We help millions make smarter spending decisions across discovery, evaluation, and (re-)purchase by connecting people with the right brands and retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;mb-2 whitespace-pre-wrap&quot;&gt;Our 1,000+ team across 10 countries builds products used every day at global scale, where you’ll have real ownership and see your impact. Want to shape the destinations people rely on to shop with confidence? Keep reading.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;section&gt;
&lt;section&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical SEO Manager to join our Marketing team in the Madrid Office. This position ensures the technical SEO integrity of our multilingual community commerce platform across nine international markets - like &lt;a href=&quot;http://mydealz.de&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;mydealz.de&lt;/a&gt;, hotukdeals, and more. It combines classic Technical SEO with solid AI, data, and automation skills to ensure that indexing, category, and reporting workflows are scalable and not manual.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your contributions will help shape how millions of consumers interact with our platforms, guiding them to make smart, fair, and rewarding choices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Atolls, we believe in nurturing both your professional and personal growth. Here’s what you can expect:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that values personal and professional development, with internal mobility opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A supportive and open-minded team that embraces diverse perspectives and innovative ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;32 days of paid vacation plus your birthday off, giving you the time you need to recharge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flexible hybrid working scheme to balance work and life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to a learning budget and internal training to help you grow in your role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health coaching to support your well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular global and local get-togethers to celebrate successes and build connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The possibility of taking a sabbatical after three years with the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cloud-based company setup, providing flexibility and collaboration opportunities no matter where you are.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*These are global benefits that apply to all employees, with additional local perks based on your location.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;Conduct technical audits, crawl/log-file analyses, and manage indexation (noindex, canonicals, robots.txt) to resolve issues on a platform with large URL volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically advance our Entity Optimization and Semantic Search capabilities through structured data (Schema.org) and internal linking to build a machine-readable Knowledge Graph.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the technical readiness of the platform for generative search engines (GEO) and AI-powered answers (AIO), including managing AI crawlers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and automate internal tools, apps, and monitoring workflows using an AI-first approach with tools like Claude, Lovable, v0, Cursor, and n8n.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish workflows to measure and analyze our visibility within AI answers and translate SEO goals into actionable technical requirements for Product &amp;amp; Tech teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone with deep experience in technical SEO for large-scale websites, who has a proven ability to leverage AI and automation to create scalable systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with Screaming Frog, GSC, Ahrefs/SISTRIX/SEMrush; HTML/CSS, JS rendering, Schema.org;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of entity-based search and Knowledge Graphs; AI-first building with LLMs (Claude, Lovable, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: Dashboarding, database experience, programmatic SEO, and experience building agent/tooling infrastructures (n8n).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience isolating platform-wide patterns and algorithmic anomalies across all markets, distinguishing business impact from digital noise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systematically dissects root causes when algorithms change, finding creative workarounds where standard tools reach their limits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating highly complex technical SEO dependencies into clear business value for Product Owners and developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently identifies and prioritizes high-impact actions and documents workflows to ensure team resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, both written and spoken in English; any other language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TA Call&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet one of our Talent Experts and get to know Atolls better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Round&lt;/strong&gt;: Focus on the technical aspects of the role &lt;em&gt;(Through a Live Case)&lt;/em&gt;, and meet your potential manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Round&lt;/strong&gt;: Meet other Atollians 🏝️&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It varies from 1 to 3 interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
